# https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/blob/master/GUIDE.md#configuration-file

### Don't let ripgrep vomit really long lines to my terminal.
--max-columns=150

### Search files listed in .gitignore too (only the directories below are skipped)
--no-ignore

### Display hidden files
--hidden

### Ignore directories
--glob=!.angular/
--glob=!.cache/
--glob=!.git/
--glob=!.next/
--glob=!.playwright-mcp/
--glob=!coverage/
--glob=!dist/
--glob=!node_modules/
--glob=!storybook-static/
--glob=!tmp/
